SUMMARY:Designing Better Data Models with an AI Coding Agent
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nData modeling is one of the hardest
  parts of building distributed applications\, and it's easy to get wrong e
 arly. This session explores how an agent can help design containers\, part
 ition keys\, relationships\, and access patterns for Azure Cosmos DB while
  teaching developers how to validate those recommendations.\n\nCheck out t
 he [CosmosDB Agent Kit](https://aka.ms/CosmosDB-agentkit)\n\n📍 This ses
 sion is a part of a series - learn more [here](https://developer.microsoft
 .com/reactor/series/S-1678/?wt.mc_id=meetup_27240_webpage_reactor)
